<h2 style="color: #27ae60;">Verify Your Email Address</h2>

<p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

<p>Welcome to BlackPot! To complete your account setup, please verify your email address by clicking the link below.</p>

<div class="info-box">
  <p style="margin: 0;">This will activate your account and allow you to access all features of the BlackPot platform.</p>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 24px; text-align: center;">
  <a href="{{{verificationLink}}}" class="button" style="display: inline-block;">Verify Email Address</a>
</p>

<p style="text-align: center; color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 13px;">Or copy this code and enter it in your account:</p>
<p style="text-align: center; background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px;">
  {{verificationCode}}
</p>

<h3 style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2c3e50;">Your Account Details</h3>

<div class="info-box">
  <table style="margin: 0;">
    <tr>
      <td>Email:</td>
      <td style="text-align: right;"><strong>{{email}}</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Account Type:</td>
      <td style="text-align: right;">{{accountType}}</td>
    </tr>
    {{#if restaurantName}}
    <tr>
      <td>Restaurant:</td>
      <td style="text-align: right;">{{restaurantName}}</td>
    </tr>
    {{/if}}
    <tr>
      <td>Verification Expires:</td>
      <td style="text-align: right;">{{expiryTime}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<h3 style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2c3e50;">Why Verify?</h3>

<ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
  <li>Secure your account with a verified email</li>
  <li>Receive important account notifications</li>
  <li>Enable password recovery options</li>
  <li>Unlock all platform features</li>
</ul>

{{#if didNotSignUp}}
<div class="alert-box">
  <strong>Didn't Sign Up?</strong>
  <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0;">If you didn't create a BlackPot account, please <a href="mailto:support@blackpot.com">contact us</a> or ignore this email. Your email address will not be used.</p>
</div>
{{/if}}

<h3 style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2c3e50;">Getting Started</h3>

<p>After verifying your email, you'll be able to:</p>
<ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
  <li>Set up your restaurant profile</li>
  <li>Configure staff members and permissions</li>
  <li>Import your menu items</li>
  <li>Start managing orders and reservations</li>
  <li>Access analytics and reports</li>
</ul>

<p style="margin-top: 20px;">
  Need help? Check out our <a href="{{{helpCenter}}}">Getting Started Guide</a> or <a href="mailto:support@blackpot.com">contact support</a>.
</p>

<p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px;">
  Verification Code: {{verificationCode}} | Expires: {{expiryTime}} | Request ID: {{requestId}}
</p>